          "performance_hint": "焦急、抱怨"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "repairer",
          "text": "让让。先断电，再测阻值。别碰控制台。",
          "audio_cue_ref": "sfx_toolbox_drop",
          "performance_hint": "冷静、专业"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "host",
          "text": "林师傅你可算来了，停播我没法交代啊。",
          "performance_hint": "无奈、诉苦"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "repairer",
          "text": "我是维修员。退后，别挡光。",
          "performance_hint": "简短、不容置疑"
        }
