          "performance_hint": "笃定、指令清晰"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "host",
          "text": "哎哟，这螺丝刀怎么这么滑……我帮你擦地。",
          "audio_cue_ref": "sfx_water_splash",
          "performance_hint": "笨拙、自嘲"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "repairer",
          "text": "你拿反了。去那边，把水吸干。",
          "performance_hint": "嫌弃但耐心"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "host",
